FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]report-additions[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]report-additions: add suggest, default, bounds, line, filled, per-choice[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, dated_notes, legacy, and a semantic schema fingerprint to album [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list JSON, and emit the record block in Obsidian's YAML sequence style [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with round-trip fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob albums update writer[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]schema-writer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report-additions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-writer: add bob albums update with a JSON ops envelope, dry-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diffs and impact counts, a fingerprint guard, Rust-side validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]span-preserving emit, one scoped transactional commit with index [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rebuild, typed refusals, and inverse ops.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Collapsed schema summary, chip view, and read-only Schema Card[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]header-reshape[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report-additions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-reshape: reshape the album header's schema surface into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collapsed-by-default summary line, an expandable chip view with usage [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, a read-only Schema Card modal, and a YAML jump with lint marks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from bob's issues.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Editable Schema Card gestures with consequences and Undo[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]card-editor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after header-reshape, schema-writer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-ed