D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-kr.2.1[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Guarded album schema update writer[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Complete bob-cli-kr.2 with a dry-runnable albums update command [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that validates ordered schema edits, preserves unrelated bytes, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]commits the rebuilt index atomically, and returns safe inverse [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]operations for Undo.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]album_schema_writer.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/album_schema_writer.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/album_schema_render_and_edit.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-kr.2.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-kr/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-kr.2.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Validate ordered schema operations and their consequences[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schema-ops[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-ops: implement the typed update protocol, pure ordered [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operations, complete-record impact accounting, shared Rust validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed refusals, and semantic inverse operations. No public command yet.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preserve schema spans and compose a reversible index edit[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schema-spans[dim] · [dim][/dim]after schema-ops[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-spans: implement conservative nested YAML span edits, exact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inverse restoration metadata, and the read-only album update planner [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]combining schema and records-index changes with guarded dependencies.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ship the guarded albums update command and its contract[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schema-command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after schema-spans[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-command: expose albums update through the CLI and completion, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integrate the planner with the shared transaction and a no-sync no-op [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, document the JSON protocol, and prove refusals, rollback, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]concurrency, scoped commits, and sync outcomes.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kr.2.1","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kr.2.1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f1b8ba20e77d999a85df8a5a6138b96e","started_at":"2026-11-12T12:58:16.171720+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2.1.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2.1.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2.1.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.2.1.land","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.4","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land"]}
